            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white shadow-sm">
          <img
            src="/images/landing/booster-jagung-kuning-kerdil-tongkol-jumbo/testi-3.webp"
            alt="Pak Wayan Darma di Lampung Timur berdiri di samping mobil pikap penuh karung panen jagung sambil memegang tongkol jumbo"
            class="aspect-[16/9] w-full object-cover"
            width="960"
            height="536"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="p-3.5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <h3 class="text-[14px] font-bold text-slate-950">Pak Wayan Darma, Lampung Timur</h3>
              <span class="rounded bg-emerald-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900">Hemat Pupuk Kimia</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-[12px] leading-snug text-slate-700 italic">
              "Lahan asam di Lampung Timur biasanya bikin jagung kerdil. <strong class="bg-emerald-100 px-1 text-emerald-900 not-italic">Sejak pakai BENSU, pemakaian pupuk tabur lebih irit tapi tongkolnya besar-besar dan biji oranye mengilap!</strong>"
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fullwidth Overclaim Panorama -->
      <div class="-mx-5 mt-6 relative">
        <img
          src="/images/landing/booster-jagung-kuning-kerdil-tongkol-jumbo/hamparan-kebun.webp"
          alt="Hamparan luas kebun jagung hibrida Indonesia yang tumbuh seragam hijau subur siap panen raya"
          class="aspect-[16/9] w-full object-cover"
          width="960"
          height="536"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="bg-slate-950 py-2 px-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[#BBF7D0]">
            Andalan Sentra Jagung: Jatim, Jateng, Lampung, NTB, Sulsel & Sumut — Aman Dicampur Perekat/Insektisida!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2-Card Final Overclaim Showcase -->
      <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 items-stretch gap-3">
        <div class="flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
          <img
            src="/images/landing/booster-jagung-kuning-kerdil-tongkol-jumbo/panen-rekor.webp"
            alt="Gunungan panen tongkol jagung hibrida oranye jumbo bernas penuh sampai ujung"
            class="aspect-[3/2] w-full shrink-0 object-cover object-center"
            width="960"
            height="644"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center px-3 py-2.5 text-center">
            <h3 class="text-[12px] font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900">Full Sampai Ujung</h3>
